---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Target 容错与 Session 模型绑定
  accDescr: v1 中每个模型配置一个当前 Profile 内的 Target。发送失败时先区分瞬时故障和永久能力不足；瞬时故障只影响当前请求，预算内恢复成功才返回结果，耗尽则返回错误，且两者都不改变 Session 绑定。永久能力或上下文不足时，只有执行计划内存在合格升级模型且预算允许才发送升级请求；成功后更新 auto Session 绑定，失败则返回错误，系统不会自动降级。

  MODEL["已选模型"] --> TARGET["当前 Profile Target<br/>v1 每模型一个"] --> SEND["发送请求"]
  SEND --> RESULT{"结果"}
  RESULT -->|"成功"| DONE["返回结果"]
  RESULT -->|"瞬时 429 / 5xx / 不可用"| TEMP["仅当前请求<br/>按预算重试或切换"]
  TEMP --> RECOVERED{"当前请求恢复？"}
  RECOVERED -->|"是"| TEMP_DONE["返回结果<br/>Session 保持原绑定"]
  RECOVERED -->|"否，预算耗尽"| TEMP_FAILED["返回明确错误<br/>Session 保持原绑定"]
  RESULT -->|"永久能力或上下文不足"| UPGRADE{"计划内有合格升级模型<br/>且预算允许？"}
  UPGRADE -->|"否"| UPGRADE_FAILED["返回明确错误"]
  UPGRADE -->|"是"| UPGRADE_SEND["占用模型切换 / 回答预算<br/>发送升级模型 Target"]
  UPGRADE_SEND --> UPGRADE_RESULT{"预算内尝试后成功？"}
  UPGRADE_RESULT -->|"是"| BIND["更新 Session 绑定<br/>并返回结果"]
  UPGRADE_RESULT -->|"否，硬失败或预算耗尽"| UPGRADE_FAILED
  BIND -. "不会自动降级" .-> KEEP["后续 auto 请求<br/>保持升级后的绑定"]

  classDef primary fill:#f7fbfd,color:#172229,stroke:#526f7e,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef runtime fill:#e7f7f6,color:#172229,stroke:#2d7774,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef decision fill:#fff4e7,color:#172229,stroke:#965b15,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef fallback fill:#e8f2ff,color:#172229,stroke:#3f75a3,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef session fill:#eef0ff,color:#172229,stroke:#625eb5,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef result fill:#eaf6ee,color:#172229,stroke:#34794b,stroke-width:2px;
  class MODEL,TARGET primary;
  class SEND runtime;
  class RESULT,RECOVERED,UPGRADE,UPGRADE_RESULT decision;
  class TEMP fallback;
  class UPGRADE_SEND runtime;
  class KEEP,BIND session;
  class DONE,TEMP_DONE result;
  class TEMP_FAILED,UPGRADE_FAILED fallback;
